        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Knight Variant </strong>is a thoughtful, challenging single-player 2D puzzle game inspired by the unique movement of the knight in chess. Your task is simple in concept but complex in execution: place a knight on the board and move it according to standard chess rules, aiming to visit as many squares as possible before you run out of moves or legal options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session challenges your planning and foresight — can you outthink the board and cover every square? With four difficulty modes adjusting the number of moves available, you'll find a level for every player, whether you're a casual puzzler or a seasoned chess strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Strategic Challenge:</strong> Move the knight across an 8x8 board, maximizing the number of visited squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♟️ <strong>Multiple Difficulties:</strong> Four modes to test your planning and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements based on how far you travel, your final position, and how many squares you conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Use Shift + Click to plan future moves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King — steady and unstoppable — or a true Knight — clever, daring, and relentless?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Knight Variant </strong>is a thoughtful, challenging single-player 2D puzzle game inspired by the unique movement of the knight in chess. Your task is simple in concept but complex in execution: place a knight on the board and move it according to standard chess rules, aiming to visit as many squares as possible before you run out of moves or legal options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session challenges your planning and foresight — can you outthink the board and cover every square? With four difficulty modes adjusting the number of moves available, you'll find a level for every player, whether you're a casual puzzler or a seasoned chess strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Strategic Challenge:</strong> Move the knight across an 8x8 board, maximizing the number of visited squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♟️ <strong>Multiple Difficulties:</strong> Four modes to test your planning and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements based on how far you travel, your final position, and how many squares you conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Use Shift + Click to plan future moves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King — steady and unstoppable — or a true Knight — clever, daring, and relentless?</p>",
        "short_description": "Master the Knight’s challenge! Move a knight across the 2D chessboard, visiting as many squares as possible within limited moves. Plan ahead, think like a strategist — are you a swift King or a true Knight?",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
